  - scrapling/engines/antibot/awswaf.py and _awswaf_solver.py (markers, challenge wait)
  - scrapling/engines/antibot/kasada.py and _kasada_solver.py (status gating, markers, token listener)
  - scrapling/engines/antibot/cloudflare.py (_cf_chl_ctx marker, error-page check)

